 "notes": "Collection cataloguing: 44 old names cut to the CLZ archetype plus 12 leaders; dropped dead or unmaintained names (Achriom, All My Books, Book Crawler, BookCAT, CATraxx, Gerty, Golden Records, Home Library, Home inv, Itemtopia, Libri, MeD's Movie Manager, Mediaman, My Library, My Music Collection, Mylists.info, Partaki, TinyCat, Vinco, csBooks, iBookshelf, iCollect Books Pro, iKeepm, mycollections). Delicious Library kept as a leader only because the brief names it; the Classic shelf may take it. Genealogy software, Home & garden design software and Ham radio software are new kinds, sourced from Wikipedia articles, the CLZ App Store page, Planner 5D and N1MM update pages. Not retrieved and therefore omitted: Heredis, Reunion details, Ancestry and MyHeritage web services, SDR# details, Log4OM details, garden-planner makers."
